### Register Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Create Ride (ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceLocation": "Office A",
  "destinationLocation": "Residential Area 1",
  "rideDateTime": "2026-02-20T09:00:00",
  "totalSeats": 4
}

### List Admin Rides (ADMIN, paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/rides?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_jwt_token}}

### Search Rides (EMPLOYEE, paginated with filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/rides?page=0&size=10&source=Office&destination=Residential
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_jwt_token}}

### Book Ride (EMPLOYEE)
POST http://localhost:8080/rides/1/book
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_jwt_token}}

### Cancel Booking (EMPLOYEE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bookings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_jwt_token}}

### Get My Bookings (EMPLOYEE)
GET http://localhost:8080/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_jwt_token}}

